  "body": "Fourth production-readiness upgrade, stacked on PR #51.\n\nScope is deliberately limited to **layered provenance**.\n\nAdds:\n- automatic `layered_provenance.json/md`;\n- explicit `scan-body provenance-layers DB --out-dir DIR` regeneration command;\n- E0 source/evidence, E1 mechanical anatomy, E2 semantic interpretation, E3 reconstruction contract, E4 human description layers;\n- per-object coverage preserved exactly from the canonical semantic graph;\n- typed backward proof traversal to evidence/source IDs;\n- immediate and lower-layer support IDs;\n- contradiction relation visibility;\n- explicit `UNCLASSIFIED` handling for future object types;\n- refresh after semantic-overlay ingestion and reconstruction promotion so E2/E3 projections cannot go stale.\n\nAuthority boundary:\n- `scan_index.sqlite` remains the single canonical graph;\n- no duplicate provenance database;\n- no confidence aggregation;\n- no promotion;\n- E4 is presentation-only and cannot upgrade lower-layer evidence.\n\nParity scenarios/distribution remains the next independent roadmap stage.",
